  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EVERY GIRL IN SCHOOL PROJECT YR 3 GRANT YEAR 3 OF 3 - FINAL YEAR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &apos;Every Girl in School&apos; project aims to ensure that children, especially girls and those with disabilities, in Kajiado and Turkana attain a quality primary education. The key elements of the project include; the provision of gender and disability-friendly WASH facilities in schools; the creation of a more child-friendly learning environment and support for education; and community sensitisation of harmful traditional practices.</narrative>
  </description>
